  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (1201 DL(2-) 01 rev C3, dated 16.12.2014; 1201 SK-02 rev N, dated 23.02.2015; 1201 SK-03 rev Q, dated 23.02.2015; 1201 SK-05 rev B, dated 27.09.2013; Planning Design and Access Statement 365, dated February 2015; Daylight and Sunlight Report, dated Dec 2014; Marketing information, dated 24th February 2015. - received 09/03/2015) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The A3 use hereby permitted shall not be open to customers outside the following times - 7am to 11pm.",
    "Condition : 4 - No deliveries shall be taken at or dispatched from the site outside the hours of 9am to 11 pm nor at any time on Sundays, Bank or Public Holidays.",
    "Condition : 5 - The external front podium area and forecourt shall not be used in conjunction with the hereby approved A3 use outside the following times 9am-9.30pm.",
    "Condition : 6 - All waste, refuse, and recycling bins shall be stored on-site and shall not be moved outside except to an awaiting vehicle after which they shall be immediately returned to within the site. No refuse or recyclable materials shall be stored outside the site.",
    "Condition : 7 - The use hereby permitted for A3 purpose shall not be begun until full particulars and details of a scheme to insulate the premises against the transmission of airborne and impact sound has been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority and the development shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with any approval given.",
    "Condition : 8 - The railings hereby approved shall be installed before the development is first occupied and shall be retained and maintained thereafter for the lifetime of the development.",
    "Condition : 9 - Before the residential flat hereby approved is first occupied, details of obscure glazing or alternative screening treatment to the flat shall be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority and shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with any approval given and retained for the lifetime of the development."
  ],
